      "cookedHtml": "<p>从<a href=\"https://linux.do/t/topic/2712260\">关于这位佬要的解释</a>继续讨论：</p>\n<p>今天上午我也自测了一下，给大家看一眼<br>\n先看所谓的掺假记录<br>\n</p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/b/8/d/b8d6f1ad05d38e31e8602c072cde933d32fb2ee4.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/qnamWvcJHbymi1qhzK9WJSIgiVe.png?dl=1\" title=\"ef8c8bd2d284d1f828340b0243758a9c\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/b/8/d/b8d6f1ad05d38e31e8602c072cde933d32fb2ee4.png\" alt=\"ef8c8bd2d284d1f828340b0243758a9c\" data-base62-sha1=\"qnamWvcJHbymi1qhzK9WJSIgiVe\" width=\"690\" height=\"225\" data-dominant-color=\"232B33\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">ef8c8bd2d284d1f828340b0243758a9c</span><span class=\"informations\">833×272 9.16 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><p></p>\n<p>记住这个时间 2026-08-06 11:59:00<br>\n再看调用日志</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/5/a/0/5a07a3d05afc353116db08f6a51629ebdf088e5a.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/cQrl7PpbgIZsiU2ovOVBprs5h4C.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/a/0/5a07a3d05afc353116db08f6a51629ebdf088e5a_2_690x381.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"cQrl7PpbgIZsiU2ovOVBprs5h4C\" width=\"690\" height=\"381\" srcset=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/a/0/5a07a3d05afc353116db08f6a51629ebdf088e5a_2_690x381.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/a/0/5a07a3d05afc353116db08f6a51629ebdf088e5a_2_1035x571.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/a/0/5a07a3d05afc353116db08f6a51629ebdf088e5a_2_1380x762.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"2F3034\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1415×783 52.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><p></p>\n<p>最后看号池日志<br>\n</p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/c/8/d/c8dcab6be9097cf39b460397d2b5c49cac42715b.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/sEUh962xwNX733qy1qOrKoIck6T.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/8/d/c8dcab6be9097cf39b460397d2b5c49cac42715b_2_690x70.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"sEUh962xwNX733qy1qOrKoIck6T\" width=\"690\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/8/d/c8dcab6be9097cf39b460397d2b5c49cac42715b_2_690x70.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/8/d/c8dcab6be9097cf39b460397d2b5c49cac42715b_2_1035x105.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/c/8/d/c8dcab6be9097cf39b460397d2b5c49cac42715b_2_1380x140.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F5F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">4474×456 266 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><p></p>\n<h1><a name=\"p-21269466-h-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-21269466-h-1\" aria-label=\"标题链接\"></a>结束，接着奏乐接着舞</h1>\n<p>给看不懂的佬稍微说明下，之前那个帖子拿着 <a href=\"https://github.com/chen-006/gpt56_api_detector\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub - chen-006/gpt56_api_detector: 用于检测api是否路由真实gpt5.6模型 · GitHub</a><br>\n这个开源项目的监测结果说我掺假，于是我自己监测了一下，第一张图就这个开源项目的监测结果，然后我在星辰后台找到了对应的调用记录，也就是第二张图，最后一张图就是对应调用记录的账号调用记录，可以很直观的看到，这是一个gpt plus账号的 gpt-5.6sol模型调用记录</p>\n<p>所以，这个开源项目的监测结果是不准确的，如果说他是准的，那就是在说奥特曼掺假。<br>\n</p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/b/c/3/bc36f26d2dbd4c38c4cfe914942b98e6496abbd1.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/qR1uf73P8RcvfArALtuOwpNPn0t.png?dl=1\" title=\"ef83bee7faebf9ed7e9283b7938c2e01\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/b/c/3/bc36f26d2dbd4c38c4cfe914942b98e6496abbd1_2_690x28.png\" alt=\"ef83bee7faebf9ed7e9283b7938c2e01\" data-base62-sha1=\"qR1uf73P8RcvfArALtuOwpNPn0t\" width=\"690\" height=\"28\" srcset=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/b/c/3/bc36f26d2dbd4c38c4cfe914942b98e6496abbd1_2_690x28.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/b/c/3/bc36f26d2dbd4c38c4cfe914942b98e6496abbd1_2_1035x42.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/b/c/3/bc36f26d2dbd4c38c4cfe914942b98e6496abbd1_2_1380x56.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F7F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">ef83bee7faebf9ed7e9283b7938c2e01</span><span class=\"informations\">3048×128 39.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><p></p>",
      "normalizedText": "从关于这位佬要的解释继续讨论： 今天上午我也自测了一下，给大家看一眼 先看所谓的掺假记录 ef8c8bd2d284d1f828340b0243758a9c833×272 9.16 KB 记住这个时间 2026-08-06 11:59:00 再看调用日志 image1415×783 52.5 KB 最后看号池日志 image4474×456 266 KB 结束，接着奏乐接着舞 给看不懂的佬稍微说明下，之前那个帖子拿着 GitHub - chen-006/gpt56_api_detector: 用于检测api是否路由真实gpt5.6模型 · GitHub 这个开源项目的监测结果说我掺假，于是我自己监测了一下，第一张图就这个开源项目的监测结果，然后我在星辰后台找到了对应的调用记录，也就是第二张图，最后一张图就是对应调用记录的账号调用记录，可以很直观的看到，这是一个gpt plus账号的 gpt-5.6sol模型调用记录 所以，这个开源项目的监测结果是不准确的，如果说他是准的，那就是在说奥特曼掺假。 ef83bee7faebf9ed7e9283b7938c2e013048×128 39.6 KB",
